 @line 
  +correction



00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,200
>simon: 我戴了。


00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:51,200
>lan: 哦。


00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,200
>simon: 然後,我。


00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:54,200
