 @line
  +translation zh-Hant
   啊,對,度數高
  +translation en
   my prescription is really strong


00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:01,200
>simon: JA:度が高い」かも
 @line
  +translation zh-Hant
   啊,對,度數高
  +translation en
   my prescription is really strong


00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:03,200
>lan: 度が高い（度數高）。
 @line
  +translation zh-Hant
   啊,對,度數高
  +translation en
   my prescription is really strong


00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:08,200
>lan: 所以我的眼鏡從小到大都超貴的。


00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:15,200
>lan: 那個,我記得我小時候配一個眼鏡可能就要五萬日幣吧。


00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,200
>simon: 五萬?


00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:19,200
>simon: 五萬😲


