　 度數高,所以如果用便宜的鏡片的話,就非常厚　　
  +translation en
　 my prescription is really strong, so if I didn't get the expensive lenses they'd end up really thick



00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:51,200
>simon: JA:双眼鏡みたいになる？(?)。
 @line
